msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A3832915_2CD3_4509_9CB5_A5D2CEB1D45C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫—nothing. ⟪k:1⟫He could not speak."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫— mais aucun son n’en sortit. ⟪k:1⟫Il ne pouvait pas parler."

#: scenario:scenario_F3238D63_F0DF_4916_94E5_10AA2F5002F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 22e6d907bc7432634cddef6d5bd589b7ce96488711a7a2b041ad4da4cd69ce56
#. default-sha256: b9dc33cf0e0cc17a4962b5b9eeddb1e3d4607a24259741208d4cee0a410658b8
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F3238D63_F0DF_4916_94E5_10AA2F5002F0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The silhouette hanging above him was certainly the White-Haired Girl’s. ⟪k:1⟫Or was it? ⟪k:2⟫"
"Because his next words were—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La silhouette qui se tenait au-dessus de lui était sans aucun doute la Fille aux Cheveux "
"Blancs. ⟪k:1⟫Non ? ⟪k:2⟫Parce que ses prochains mots furent—"

#: scenario:scenario_71606EEB_9DAB_4875_B9AD_52E5AFA70C4E
