msgctxt "scenario:scenario_19CA1D14_E2F2_4A56_B339_D8285223D006"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That wasn’t very nice..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ce n’était pas très gentil..."

#: scenario:scenario_2B55BD27_3FD5_4A63_86AC_84FA9D2F569C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 95c1224a161cee636a37580f8270185b3b1e425149a95677fbafbb6d35695693
#. default-sha256: db1b982d214f1fa4ac4e90e8748b46270e0d2595d07e6c5941dd1cd0ef257cb9
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2B55BD27_3FD5_4A63_86AC_84FA9D2F569C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Veiled in darkness, she slowly lifted her head. ⟪k:1⟫And then—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫there was another "
"flash of lightning.⟪k:4⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Drapée dans l’obscurité, elle releva lentement la tête. ⟪k:1⟫Et là—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ il y eut un "
"autre éclair.⟪k:4⟫"

#: scenario:scenario_AE6F7AD3_974C_4BEE_881E_691681260D1C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 273aa9bf756a40d454b8b30f5a388af7cc414fb256fdf3cea650aba0ec0348d6
#. default-sha256: 987e2271cf933e3dc9bd4d68e6c574b893e0b21807ca43663023a90c32a5ca08
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_AE6F7AD3_974C_4BEE_881E_691681260D1C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The heavy fabric of the curtains rustled, bolts of light streaming between the gaps."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Le lourd tissu des rideaux bruissa, la lumière de la foudre s’infiltra dans la chambre."

#: scenario:scenario_E0BE2D06_DD56_40C9_863A_9A4AAF6A3D39
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4e597082fd0c28bb67ccb59634ba89e3f78a6361b67a241b134c473e3c5445ae
#. default-sha256: 0c73489e7ed3a6d517fa4698fe88a0deddb517375afe1ebc1202ec3531ae4629
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E0BE2D06_DD56_40C9_863A_9A4AAF6A3D39"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Her flaxen irises glimmered. ⟪k:21⟫Though in the bluish-white light, they took "
"on a twinge of almost golden glow."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Ses iris noisette scintillèrent. ⟪k:21⟫Dans la lumière bleutée, ils prenaient "
"une teinte presque dorée."

#: scenario:scenario_96413F74_9E88_415D_9DEB_7741E6D711E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 93800791d614277e014e4b4065ea62f49f89e66df0253895158e56dda5b9919a
#. default-sha256: 82bb80da6f24d026b3888e58189687b9b5902f5ba90f5934777aa480b75e0aa5
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_96413F74_9E88_415D_9DEB_7741E6D711E4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No need to be so rough.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫This isn’t the first time she’s visited your bedchamber,"
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫is it, Mell?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nul besoin d’être aussi brutal.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ce n’est pas la première fois que je viens dans ta "
"chambre,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫n’est-ce pas, Mell ?"

#: scenario:scenario_F689B45C_AAEA_445E_B158_18D9E7B52AA2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 50d298e7b3da549aed0b879eb39ef1c1d03257e18db15cae50b8cce7a9a0dd94
#. default-sha256: 90765aae746c6fb47b5c6138127f2ce9037e49ebc46bcc43ed6877b1e309b96b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F689B45C_AAEA_445E_B158_18D9E7B52AA2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Or did I not kiss you the same way?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Tell me, how does she run her fingers across "
"your skin?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫What does she do when she nuzzles up to you?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ne t’ai-je pas embrassé de la même manière ?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Dis-moi, comment te caresse-t-elle la "
"peau ?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Que fait-elle quand elle se blottit contre toi ?"

#: scenario:scenario_706E20D7_6B3F_44A1_A31B_28781913B2C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea68d995e57b63daeebfd96275b792ae737603d60d5fcb856c4eb25ce6ffdf55
#. default-sha256: fd4308bc05d5b2c6149b3a816fe81d5fdd9c82f59d6bd4f3fe2a32d6e2d2721e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_706E20D7_6B3F_44A1_A31B_28781913B2C8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫S— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Stop— ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Stop this madness, ⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Nellie!⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Wh-"
"⟪k:11⟫Why would you... ⟪k:12⟫Why would you do this?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Arrête— ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫arrête cette folie, ⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Nellie !⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫P-"
"⟪k:11⟫Pourquoi tu... ⟪k:12⟫Pourquoi tu fais une chose pareille ?!"

#: scenario:scenario_0F60EA05_B15B_455C_9597_EE4D757E9178
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 253716aa63f2880d36c2762d695287155c127071e5d66b28e12f538eef6b723a
#. default-sha256: 7f9785dbbaf0562673f17e115b50c401dee714ca259b19c3f1ea0e4be99b1181
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0F60EA05_B15B_455C_9597_EE4D757E9178"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Because you like white hair, don’t you, Mell?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You like white hair, which is why you "
"fell for her, isn’t it?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Parce que tu aimes les cheveux blancs, n’est-ce pas, Mell ?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Tu aimes les cheveux "
"blancs, c’est pour cela que tu es tombé amoureux d’elle, non ?"

#: scenario:scenario_6584834B_2B27_4C60_BECD_C69EC8D9FC5F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4adb3b0cb721f7c2181f9b5c2c0aa7a106bf4701c322cc6b5ed41cb110fbd45a
#. default-sha256: aa8cb2518658afd2dcdf3c6a0356941b47e7105177523fa0fbc5e170213c1663
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_6584834B_2B27_4C60_BECD_C69EC8D9FC5F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ahaha... ⟪k:1⟫So if I have white hair, then you’ll fall for me too.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Then I can be "
"your princess again, dearest Mell."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ahaha... ⟪k:1⟫Donc, si j’ai des cheveux blancs, tu tomberas amoureux de moi aussi.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"Et alors, je pourrai redevenir ta princesse, mon très cher Mell."

#: scenario:scenario_0581AAED_B219_4E76_9F4C_F759584F14B8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a797edac0ffd5920f896500e1a309ed829499930950e405a91b81fe2f59614d5
#. default-sha256: c546ea65e600f60b9752cc57b2ab07558ca4b4543325d4704cc173400591ed49
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0581AAED_B219_4E76_9F4C_F759584F14B8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What... ⟪k:1⟫What are you even talking about?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mais... ⟪k:1⟫Mais enfin, de quoi tu parles ?"

#: scenario:scenario_56C0EA79_04E3_4DF3_9393_D98EF0417E64
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cb55b6b35146f28b82a1de2d7654c02c0f9092a1819ca183ab0de91591057bcf
#. default-sha256: 618c93dbdfb93b4a7dae74cabf936ff2b1fbd172562e33a4c231647e13b59817
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_56C0EA79_04E3_4DF3_9393_D98EF0417E64"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He could not escape from her—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫from his sister’s piercing gaze. ⟪k:3⟫“Why?” “What "
"happened?” “How could she?”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il ne pouvait lui échapper—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ il ne pouvait échapper au regard perçant de sa sœur. "
"⟪k:3⟫« Pourquoi ? » « Que s’est-il passé ? » « Comment a-t-elle⟪k:4⟫pu ? »"

#: scenario:scenario_88E87D89_205B_45F5_854A_3EED23556195
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aff257972e29f4500ceff972e48a8dd2ac019c2d3c017a43e51ed29e957d7d93
#. default-sha256: c1ffbc9061c345229d82bb3c192b02ec8f4bb34cdb08e9f4be537ccc00adc6a7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_88E87D89_205B_45F5_854A_3EED23556195"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Questions crashed into the young man’s mind like waves in a stormy sea."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Dans la tempête de son crâne, les questions venaient se fracasser comme les vagues contre la "
"jetée."

#: scenario:scenario_7E81027E_A71F_4178_9C1E_AC4E4ACCE1E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ac58f9f7212318b38a37aa4c573bdc69818f6060a66298f5476ddc3f9ff23700
#. default-sha256: 00ef1c2bc1b0cb6588b8924581de8bc4f1df4c2863d5f045d783e2fb817887ee
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7E81027E_A71F_4178_9C1E_AC4E4ACCE1E3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But none of them found answers; they simply caused him further perplexity."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mais aucune ne trouvait de réponse ; elles ne faisaient qu’accroître sa perplexité."

#: scenario:scenario_B003D897_E99E_4E93_A1AF_0E6168B74274
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd2b9a6815c23f946fbd5f28a6c970a3e5d5842897d8cda04ec5da56a31af0d7
#. default-sha256: cbb3f7de3a17958c6dc8fa8de6d02f1a8cf2bb6dcd5ebad7b6a534c72fe27aa7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B003D897_E99E_4E93_A1AF_0E6168B74274"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Y-⟪k:1⟫Your hair...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫What happened to your hair?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫How did you... ⟪k:6⟫get it "
"that color?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫T-⟪k:1⟫Tes cheveux...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Qu’as-tu fait à tes cheveux ?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Comment as-tu...⟪k:6⟫ "
"obtenu cette couleur ?"

#: scenario:scenario_F013A957_0815_4057_962E_7B318845C66F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
