msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But that wasn’t how it turned out. ⟪k:1⟫The child had white hair!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫She didn’t look "
"at all like she carried the Rhodes family blood!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais ce n’est pas ce qui s’est passé. ⟪k:1⟫L’enfant avait les cheveux blancs !⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Elle "
