msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Th-⟪k:1⟫That doesn’t make any sense...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I don’t believe a word you’re saying.⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫It couldn’t possibly be true..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ce-⟪k:1⟫C’est insensé...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Je n’en crois pas un mot.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Ça ne peut pas être "
"vrai..."

#: scenario:scenario_0D671DCA_8D23_4F5E_8454_F092A3B1CDD3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ad90d85cabb935f91aef93e263c8ba014d2d807cae10cff18cd93c0ad9bb3f60
