msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0D671DCA_8D23_4F5E_8454_F092A3B1CDD3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Wouldn’t it be nice if you could bury your head in the sand?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But Mell, feigning "
"ignorance is a sin."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tu aimerais bien faire l’autruche et te cacher la tête dans le sable, hein ?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mais, "
"Mell, feindre l’ignorance est péché."

#: scenario:scenario_E81F2D06_B79F_4E22_A734_38D5AEF6B3A2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
