#: scenario:scenario_B2802064_B13D_4F0A_BDF7_2BF04B9F62D6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3acb43bd55958a488046de90d80986f83bc7865a07bbde652ca2d428a4e82956
