#: scenario:scenario_94283E73_C8A6_456E_B488_CE6597B84FFE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a558239e645d30ecc0fb7f495d219705716e2b40656599bc1ca00fc0d83b4032
